EvaluationChecks equal(actual, expected, name):
    Return actual when equal; otherwise signal a named failure showing both values.

EvaluationTask:
    Public fields title and completion are exposed through title/title:, completed,
    complete, reopen and summary. Start as Untitled and open. Mutators return self.

EvaluationTimedTask:
    Extend EvaluationTask with minutes/minutes:, initially zero.
    Append the estimate to the inherited summary.

arithmetic_test:
    Check receipt arithmetic, FizzBuzz with remainder, independent closure captures
    and an accumulating factorial loop. Show the FizzBuzz sequence.

collections_test:
    Decode orders, filter by total, reduce to a sum and project customer names.
    Count words, sort keys and numbers, check Unicode access and JSON round-trip.

objects_test:
    Complete one of two tasks and query the remaining task.
    Clone a task and check original state, inherited state and cloned behavior.

signals_test:
    Run a failing block with cleanup, catch its signal and check execution order.
    Check the workspace can continue evaluating after recovery.

examples_promises_test:
    Complete a task asynchronously and reuse its returned object.
    Capture an example input, run it, reset it and rerun its check.

Run these programs with smt test examples/evaluation/*_test.smt from the repository
directory. Each file starts in its own isolated runtime and fails by signaling.
shell_tasks: start a Shell, send sample lines to sort, pass its output to uniq, check each exit, print the report and return the retained command jobs for inspection.
